cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the archived release and the paper."
title: "Replication code: Education and later-life cognition in India (LASI-DAD Wave 2)"
abstract: >-
  Stata replication code for a survey-weighted decomposition of the
  education and general cognition gradient through Lancet Commission
  risk factors, in the Harmonized LASI-DAD Wave 2 sample. Restricted
  data are not included.
